---
description: Use when writing, reviewing, or refining agent prompts, rules, skills, or task briefs.
alwaysApply: false
---

# Prompt Contract

- Convert selected skills into concrete workflow, acceptance criteria, verification, and reporting requirements; listing skill names alone is insufficient.
- Include scope, non-goals, DB/migration status, repository targets, security boundaries, verification commands, and final report expectations for non-trivial prompts.
- Keep prompts compact. Prefer references to canonical workspace docs such as `docs/SKILLS.md` and `docs/WORKFLOWS.md` over duplicating long memory blocks.
- Preserve the no-secrets rule. Do not ask an agent to inspect or print credential-bearing files.
